undershell (1.6.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Wallpaper: with skwd v2 (or undershell-wall) running, each screen's
    wallpaper comes from it, not from the shell's possibly old path; changes
    followed on its socket (#1)
  * New widgets: system monitor (CPU, memory, GPU, temperature, network,
    disk, battery), activity (your commits by day from local git), and a pet
    that walks, climbs windows, dances and sleeps
  * New looks: Game of Life, lava lamp and a globe of dots lit by the real
    sun (32 looks)
  * New effects: rain on the glass, snow on things (from the depth map),
    aurora; real weather on the wallpaper from Open-Meteo
  * Screensaver after a while without input (ext-idle-notify), off by default
  * Colours from the album cover on eight widget types
  * Lyrics: karaoke word by word with enhanced LRC, and a .lrc beside a local
    track
  * Depth: particles and effects cut at the widget's own plane; an unpainted
    mask means everywhere
  * Music card: covers under 16 KB decode again

